4. Delayed settlement of balances; 

5. High turnaround times. 

In this regard , it is hereby directed that: 

- I. For all the co-insurance transactions that took place after 1s<sup>t</sup> April 2018, the balances due to/from co-insurers shall be reconciled with the balances as per ETASS; 

- II. A certificate from the statutory auditor shall be submitted to the Authority, in the format as prescribed in Annexure A, along with the annual financial state
